{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫小花鄧美欣（Venus）日前飛抵泰國度假放鬆，除了享受當地風土人情外，當然不忘為粉絲大送福利，在社交平台曬出一組性感爆燈的度假寫真，大放「震撼彈」，瞬間炸爆網民眼球引起網上騷動。</p><p>抹胸熱褲大放福利 逆天長腿直逼鏡頭</p><p>照片中的 Venus 身穿白色無肩帶微短抹胸（Tube Top），搭配側邊高開衩的棕灰色圍裹長裙，大方露出雪白纖腰與迷人鎖骨。最吸睛的莫過於她坐在深色木質梳化上時，巧妙地側身，「逆天雪白長腿」近乎全數展露於鏡頭前，極具視覺衝擊力！</p><figure><img alt=\"好唯美。（IG:venustang_)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159581222435819520278634.jpeg/q58za1KyDDJdco-CfSvyeZG1uqwjvRf0_woqFf8KKhU\"/><figcaption>好唯美。（IG:venustang_)</figcaption></figure><p>不論是微笑側臉、望鏡頭，還是優雅站立在奢華酒店大堂， Venus 都散發著濃濃法式輕奢風與泰式度假風情，美貌與身材兼備，魅力值直接拉滿。</p><p>網民暴動：呢個身材根本就係犯規！</p><p>照片一出，隨即引來大批網民及粉絲暴動留言，紛紛大讚：「睇到流晒鼻血，太性感了吧！」、「氣質又好、身材又正，泰國的天氣都夠唔夠你辣？」、「呢個身材根本就係犯規」</p><figure><img alt=\"好長腿。（IG:venustang_)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159581506008518656842736.jpeg/Irge26G3Sif4pJeDmp14B98m-U2RYKJkWWrSellq0no\"/><figcaption>好長腿。（IG:venustang_)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"性感尤物。（IG:venustang_)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159582098974052352234715.jpeg/TdENlTxIa1-awE6O5goJNvRT73lnvJ6Ig2f7BoNn-wY\"/><figcaption>性感尤物。（IG:venustang_)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"性感尤物。（IG:venustang_)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159582101520125952761504.jpeg/u8UlIlvbZa0RULiypdKKRnRxZeNyHpG7cYayS3GGsks\"/><figcaption>性感尤物。（IG:venustang_)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"在光影襯托下，盡顯性感美。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159582104091365376940157.jpeg/hMcH_E7VL5GTebLnAOSWkDtt2WSCOuPUrUNjG61DYxs\"/><figcaption>在光影襯托下，盡顯性感美。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"擺甫士好專業。（IG:venustang_)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159582106276728832248017.jpeg/1-f5KuPRgypsJwejICeC32X3ej2At3ULswDHAbMAxwE\"/><figcaption>擺甫士好專業。（IG:venustang_)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"擺甫士好專業。（IG:venustang_)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159582108600504320246891.jpeg/SdFXt-bhLIW0cQ6u-MK7D0nQR0jWXEETxHhYL8R4WC8\"/><figcaption>擺甫士好專業。（IG:venustang_)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"在光影襯托下，盡顯性感美。（IG:venustang_)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159582098978246656902374.jpeg/9sisLBbodc5xKTOb-Z5kBYJEjeUsRopePXpNrj16Ta4\"/><figcaption>在光影襯托下，盡顯性感美。（IG:venustang_)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"擺甫士好專業。（IG:venustang_)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159582101453017088152367.jpeg/JjQwK7ydZur8zlD0J9ONuJOHl98QZwuzHRGgMh0RoDI\"/><figcaption>擺甫士好專業。（IG:venustang_)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"在光影襯托下，盡顯性感美。（IG:venustang_)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159582103944564736289135.jpeg/FInktFofjUMnVqI8jSLAkGw6BwxI3p-9Sae6nkmnup4\"/><figcaption>在光影襯托下，盡顯性感美。（IG:venustang_)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"擺甫士好專業。（IG:venustang_)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159582106272534528465812.jpeg/CX5Hy87NDdo98u_sWKC4yGOPnrgEKvpqT5tyPk-bcj4\"/><figcaption>擺甫士好專業。（IG:venustang_)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"擺甫士好專業。（IG:venustang_)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159582108457897984058321.jpeg/uPeeaq3uVL0QOWowngWeaEK6Ug4USDKPk5hra5OYa2s\"/><figcaption>擺甫士好專業。（IG:venustang_)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"在光影襯托下，盡顯性感美。（IG:venustang_)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159582098651090944497635.jpeg/-kn7b9Rc8QtRhKLYmCT3gyu8FBnt9A6zetqvMnrarzI\"/><figcaption>在光影襯托下，盡顯性感美。（IG:venustang_)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（IG:venustang_)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159582101402685440271658.jpeg/AsqO4npNQ9UxTfCBXt66uAqSLY5zsupne77QKXu-0Ck\"/><figcaption>（IG:venustang_)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-31T00:39:06.706123+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":705,"images":14,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}